{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"S1 ee8a: BLOCK G6 CRITICAL — fail-loud malformed-JSON contract named only env and CLI, but config.py:585-594 shows the file table also accepts a JSON string and silently degrades it to {}. Verified. Remediated: all three layers raise, and the file layer's accepted shapes are pinned (native TOML table or JSON string; neither-shape or non-object JSON is a hard error), with 2 ACs and testing coverage for all three layers."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787714078819544001,"uuid":"a54baacb-fadb-4afb-a40d-bac6f7f7982f"}